{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1288053-ideally-how-do-you-want-reproduction-to-be-handled","id":1288053,"title":"Ideally how do you want Reproduction to be Handled","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-02-14T13:23:07-08:00","id":1288053,"title":"Ideally how do you want Reproduction to be Handled","content":"So since we don\u2019t have all the answers yet in books let\u2019s discuss this.<br /> <br /> Talents are basically human and their children most likely don\u2019t inherit Talent status, but you may go with the trop that Talented and Heroic people have Talented and Heroic children. But basically up to the SG to decide if Professor Jones Kid grows up to be Indiana Jones or Shiloh Lebouf.<br /> <br /> Psion if I recall have the issue with them being to new to have much Data. Correct me if I\u2019m wrong but didn\u2019t the Doyen design the Prometheus Chambers so they remove the potential of the subjects bloodline from having Psiad kids and instead their kids are Latents?<br /> <br /> What about Psiads though? I think I would have them have a higher chance of having Psiad children especially if they have kids with another Psiad, this gives me the option to have bloodlines of Psychics/Mystics/Witches hidden around the world. Not sure how likely I should make Psiadhood be passed onto the next generation but I do like it being say something that may be dormant in the blood for generations, kind of like a recessive trait.<br /> <br /> I forget was Latents a result of Bhurano\u2019s Noetic Wave or were they something the Doyen planned?<br /> <br /> Aberrants now are the meat and Potatoes of the discussion! Now let\u2019s ignore them being sterile and consider if that is the case it\u2019s because of a conspiracy trying to sterilize Novas to contain them, but they aren\u2019t too wide spread. But what do we want for Nova Breeding? I take Marvel as my biggest inspiration. The Earth X TrIlogy brought up the idea that Inhumans can be long lived but virtually infertile, but Attilan curbed this due to carefully arranged marriages to maximize fertility. And Early Marvel has a proclivity towards mutants producing Mutant children virtually all the time, with a handful of anomalies like Graydon Creed being the human child of Mystique and Sabertooth. They also brought up the idea that mutated superhumans have a proclivity towards their children being Born Mutants, like Franklin Richards and Spider-Man\u2019s family. In an early 90s late 80s Spidey comic he talks with Hank McCoy about what would happen if he had a kid and Hank brought up that the child could be a mutant, and I believe Spidergirl from the MC2 timeline is a mutant but with her pappy\u2019s powers.<br /> <br /> So maybe the higher the Quantum the less fertile you are through conventional means? But Aberrants with low Quantum and High Corruption are more fertile like the Aeons Space Aberrants. This also kind of goes with how the Eternals were handled by Marvel, Earth Eternals were immortal but static in Age but when a group left to populate Titan they seemed to have no problem Breeding, but there may be an implication that Science helped them, with Mentor and his Father Chronos regarded as the Fathers of Titans population. They also seemed to be over all weaker with successive generations, with Thanos being a mutant, and having experimented on himself to Enhance his body and mind. His brother Eros seems to be more potent then most Titans but his father was Mentor. The average Titan seemed to probably be superhuman but much less potent and more human then then the small number of Immortal Eternals on Earth.<br /> <br /> And then we have Mutants. They often breed in bloodlines that shares similar powers, and they stayed potent if not getting more potent with each generation, especially if they mate with another mutant rather the. Human. Like Beaks kids had a mix between his mutation and his Wife\u2019s. He seemed to be more a start of a new species, which a lot of Mutants seem to be.<br /> <br /> Which the Earth X Trilogy back. They viewed the process of mutation as evolving towards a generalized shared mutation like the Skrulls and shapeshifting. And they viewed Shapeshifting as reaching a peak of both homogeneity and vast potential. The series has it that the Celestials built a failsafe in their experiments so that when they start reaching that peak of mutation they start becoming more psychoreactive, so they don\u2019t rival the Celestials they start being shaped mind and body by the expectations of another. So the Skrulls were peaceful and were approaching this phase when the Kree stole their tech and started a million year war, which shaped the Skrulls by their prejudices and expections changing them from a peaceful civilization to A warmongering rival civilization. Reed was of the Skrulls stage of mutation, even having a form of shape mastery, and his son Franklin was at that peek stage of Mutation and had Godlike powers to rival the Celestials but he was effected by the expectations of his family, till eventually when the Universe needed a new Galactus he was convinced he was Galactus, and that Galactus wasn\u2019t Heartless.<br /> <br /> So a big thing I want for Aberrants is to have them effected by their Eruptions. The books have it Novas powers are random and subconscious derived. I want to reign this in a bit and give it structure. So those who erupt spontaneously are like Mutants and Inhumans, their powers could be anything, but they are effected by their parents powerset, perhaps the parents genes but also subconscious expections about their progeny. So Novas have kids similar to them, with powers at least somewhat related.<br /> <br /> But I want other methods of Eruption to have somewhat more stable results. Like Gamma radiation making super strong monsters, or specifically Hulks if related to one or getting a transfusion from one being a method of eruption.<br /> <br /> But if Say Dr. Connors makes a lizard serum it creates lizard Novas rather then a random eruption. So Superiors are similar to the Weapon Plus/ Project Rebirth, having a stabilizes somewhat controlled method of eruptions. Thoughts? Suggestions?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-14T14:35:24-08:00","id":1288082,"title":"","content":"Oh man, so much to read, so many references, I got a little lost, so let\u2019s beggin by Talents.<br /> <br /> Talents are, as I understand, regular humans exposed to Flux, all but one of the \u201ceruptions\u201d of talents are related to events and not birth (one is you were not supposed to be born, but you did). A son of a Talent is a Talent in potential as all the other humans.<br /> <br /> Psiads and Novas are a weird situation, as there are two main theories around them.<br /> The first one is a person is born with a gene that say if can became superhuman, and it is unlocked by psi or by quantum. So a child of a psion could became a Nova, as long it is exposed to quantum and not to psi, and a child of a nova could became a psiad if exposed to psi and not to quantum. <br /> Second Novas and Psiads are 2 totally new subspecies os humans, they can reproduce with humans and one with each other, but it will be a potential nova or a potential psiad since birth, unlocking if exposed to the proper condition.<br /> Both theories focus on fact that the eruption or psi awakening are dependent on external energy source. So a potential nova can erupt before birth if exposed to enough quantum (for example being inside of a nova), probably the same can happen o a child inside a psion, in this case being born as a psiad, possibly even a psion, as the chamber changes the DNA of the psion.<br /> <br /> About powers from novas. Novas don\u2019t have a specific power, they know how to use a specific power, their real power is unlimited, it means a nova erupting before developed any conscious have no limit to their powers. That\u2019s why second generation novas are powerful, they are born with power and their power is unlimited by definition. Of course there is a chance of the baby nova replicate their parents powers, as we replicate our parents cultural and social behaviour, but it\u2019s not about genetics, but about learning what is possible.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-14T14:47:22-08:00","id":1288086,"title":"","content":"With regard to 1E\u2019s sterilization plotline, given the political shifts since the 90s that call for anti-internationalism conspiracy theories to be more in need of deconstruction than internationalism does: I\u2019d suggest that Novas\u2019 extended lifespan is balanced by a very low rate of fertility inherently. This is not widely understood in the 2020s however and \u201cUtopia is sterilizing Novas!\u201d rises as a bullshit conspiracy theory!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-14T18:08:52-08:00","id":1288126,"title":"","content":"Sooo much fun stuff to read and digest. <br /> <br /> I will say first my thoughts. <br /> <br /> Talents don't really inherent. Thoigh bloodlimes are possible wjen it soumfs great. <br /> <br /> Psions come from chamber, thats it. <br /> <br /> Psiads and Novas inherent and pass on. Not always but a lot. Sometimes it skips a generation but offspring are often more potent. <br /> <br /> Nova children go through a soft eruption in my thought. They start tougher abd atronger in body and maybe mind but only gain actual power at a maturation point. Which could be puberty or adulthood or whatnot. <br /> <br /> NO STERILITY, nope, none. <br /> <br /> The thing is by the &quot;present&quot; not enough years have passed for the children of novas to go through their soft eruption. <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-14T18:48:38-08:00","id":1288137,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1288053-ideally-how-do-you-want-reproduction-to-be-handled?p=1288126#post1288126\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sooo much fun stuff to read and digest. <br /> <br /> I will say first my thoughts. <br /> <br /> Talents don't really inherent. Thoigh bloodlimes are possible wjen it soumfs great. <br /> <br /> Psions come from chamber, thats it. <br /> <br /> Psiads and Novas inherent and pass on. Not always but a lot. Sometimes it skips a generation but offspring are often more potent. <br /> <br /> Nova children go through a soft eruption in my thought. They start tougher abd atronger in body and maybe mind but only gain actual power at a maturation point. Which could be puberty or adulthood or whatnot. <br /> <br /> NO STERILITY, nope, none. <br /> <br /> The thing is by the &amp;quot;present&amp;quot; not enough years have passed for the children of novas to go through their soft eruption. <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019m with you on no enforced sterility, but given Nova life spans, if they reproduce at the rate of baseline humans, there\u2019s a major rapid overpopulation problem that arises. Hence my suggestion that while not being sterilized, successful conception is rare, any given Nova only successfully reproducing (if they\u2019re trying to) once in a few centuries.<br /> <br /> And this is misinterpreted in-setting as sterility. Really it\u2019s just their reproduction fitting their lifespans.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-14T22:45:03-08:00","id":1288175,"title":"","content":"Talent inheritence-Honestly Its almost more like a benign disease than anything inheritable. One Talent brings flux with them in their actions thus leading to the potential to others.. and the more Talents around the more likely someone is to become a talent. Thus Talent families happen, but more the general Reproductive source for talents is the Allegence as they are a much more extreme gathering of Talents.<br /> <br /> SIMILARLY I consider that Stalwarts and Psiads the &quot;natural&quot; might have similar setups with Quantum and Psi so you have secret magical societies.. and pantheons but they fade in and out of history.<br /> <br /> Novas and Psions are of course Unnatually produced. And thus to some extent follow the designs of their makers, Novas can reproduce BECAUSE Divis Mal wants to make a replacement Nova species, but its not a perfected process thus low fertility and he probably wants few higher quality types.<br /> <br /> Now other species seem to generally only have one option rather than three and thus go down it and it alone, so their rules are different.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-14T23:15:40-08:00","id":1288183,"title":"","content":"You are assuming far more control of the Novas\u2019 nature by Mal than I do Lian. Far as I can tell he bathed the Earth in Quantum energy to trigger eruptions, but he did not engineer Novas the way the Doyen engineered Psions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-15T00:45:32-08:00","id":1288198,"title":"","content":"Mal Do have some power over novas powers, not on creating, only on turning on and of, as he did to Pax. But Novas are a natural apparition, their level of power is related to the level of Quantum Flux on the environment, more quantum more eruptions and more power for the novas erupted, same for corruption, more corruption more corrupted novas erupted and more corruption on eruption.<br /> <br /> What Mal did on Galetea was raise the level of Quantum flux on earth to make sure Novas would erupt easier and more powerful, once it started the novas powers powers up one the next eruption and so on.<br /> <br /> I like the idea of No sterilisation. I always played as a real thing happening, but as a temporary sterilisation (like a pill or something). It makes sense the entire plot as a conspiration theory as most novas didn\u2019t reproduce yet due to a naturally low fertility. Also, if the child of a nova is aitomatcaly a nova, it would be a fast grown.<br /> <br /> Quick about second gem novas, the soft eruption happens more often inside the mother if she is a nova, and, as it was for Stalwarts, the attributes would be the first to rise, allowing a super smart kid to be conscious much faster than a regular one, gathering experience on the use of power really early, and powering up much faster. It\u2019s not a rule, just a option, they can be super tough to resist being on the mother belly, or can be born from a egg (not impossible, given corruption). Anyway their relation with powers would be more natural, same ways as kids interact better with tech.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-15T00:50:14-08:00","id":1288199,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1288053-ideally-how-do-you-want-reproduction-to-be-handled?p=1288082#post1288082\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh man, so much to read, so many references, I got a little lost, so let\u2019s beggin by Talents.<br /> <br /> Talents are, as I understand, regular humans exposed to Flux, all but one of the \u201ceruptions\u201d of talents are related to events and not birth (one is you were not supposed to be born, but you did). A son of a Talent is a Talent in potential as all the other humans.<br /> <br /> Psiads and Novas are a weird situation, as there are two main theories around them.<br /> The first one is a person is born with a gene that say if can became superhuman, and it is unlocked by psi or by quantum. So a child of a psion could became a Nova, as long it is exposed to quantum and not to psi, and a child of a nova could became a psiad if exposed to psi and not to quantum. <br /> Second Novas and Psiads are 2 totally new subspecies os humans, they can reproduce with humans and one with each other, but it will be a potential nova or a potential psiad since birth, unlocking if exposed to the proper condition.<br /> Both theories focus on fact that the eruption or psi awakening are dependent on external energy source. So a potential nova can erupt before birth if exposed to enough quantum (for example being inside of a nova), probably the same can happen o a child inside a psion, in this case being born as a psiad, possibly even a psion, as the chamber changes the DNA of the psion.<br /> <br /> About powers from novas. Novas don\u2019t have a specific power, they know how to use a specific power, their real power is unlimited, it means a nova erupting before developed any conscious have no limit to their powers. That\u2019s why second generation novas are powerful, they are born with power and their power is unlimited by definition. Of course there is a chance of the baby nova replicate their parents powers, as we replicate our parents cultural and social behaviour, but it\u2019s not about genetics, but about learning what is possible.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah i was going to make two threads but I just mashed them together into a superthread.<br /> <br /> But it\u2019s just semantics to say they don\u2019t have specific powers, that\u2019s like saying the same for humans that know how to snipe targets from a mile away don\u2019t have a specific capability, they know how to just use a capability, it can be misleading. And I\u2019m proposing a more concrete idea for things, because it\u2019s less satisfying to just have not pattern or rhyme or a reason for the power. The subconscious trigger for the power is just a method to explain comic superheroes odd cooncidences like All the Pun Names DC Villains have which relate to their powers, or how Marvel Beings coincidently develop powers they are tied to, like Blizzard using powerarmor that could Freeze things, but developing ice powers after exposure to the Terrigen Mists. Earth X also posited that the Powers of Superhumans were subconscious manifestations like Aberrant does.<br /> <br /> And I was proposing establishing patterns for Novas, because it\u2019s more satisfying to me the LOL random power roulette for everyone always. So first Gen Novas erupting from trauma and what not like the Default setting uses are seemingly random, but after but I\u2019m suggesting next gen Novas are more likely to have Children develop powers like Parents, but not always, with maybe some bloodlines having more solid power sets. And I suggested a possible reason for this could be the initial source of the Quantum, the Parents, influences their Children, as in even if Quantum powers are not genetic based, genetics could work as a key/cipher, so say Jean Grey becomes a Psychic, so her expectations of her bloodline may influence her child as much as the Child\u2019s subconscious or maybe even more. So her son Nathan has Telekinesis and Telepathy like her, but visually different. And even if a child is artificially produced and she doesn\u2019t know about it, like with Nate Grey maybe the expectations are already hammered into her blood for future generations, so he also develops telekinesis and telepathy.<br /> <br /> I suggest this so that Novas can start becoming specific bloodlines with a pattern to their power. Meanwhile the Inhumans follow a more standard Nova scheme, of Rando each time.<br /> <br /> I do believe theme Psiads are much more tied to Genetics then Aberrants, and barring extreme external tampering children of Psiads will develop into Psiads rather then Novas, Psi is antithetical to Quantum after all. I believe Psiads are probably the most stable form of reproduceable superpeople. As we see the aliens with Psi seemed to have evolved that way ages ago. Though I\u2019ll bet with controlled breeding you can make a more reliably psychic Bloodline but I think that comes with narrowing the range of Aptitudes. Species that Naturally become Quantum users seem to be far far rarer across the Universe and those which have potential in Both are rarest of them all, so rare we only know of Humanity qualifying. So most beings will die of exposed to an exotic energy Bombardment that could be used to make a human a Nova.<br /> <br /> But a big thing I am proposing is much more Nonrandom Erruptions like Novas, but specific Accident/Experiment Eruptions like Superiors. These beings are much more limited in what type of Power they get, or maybe more accurately the first to start Errupting in a specific way lock in a pattern for future Individuals who follow suit. So say Project Rebirth that made Captain America, Dr. Erskines prototype experiments with it locked in the basic power set. So as long as he uses Vita Rays combined with the Super Soldier Serum result in the perfect physical and mental specimen of humanity, rather then flight. Or Bruce Banner was Blown up and he felt rage and terror so he becomes a big super strong rage monster, and all other later Gamma Mutants follow suit and become Hulks, but if other uncontrolled factors are involved they can slightly alter the result, so Abomination mutated not just from Gamma radiation but also chemicals so he is big and strong like the Hulk, but he also has amphibious qualities and a stable strength level due to not just being a Gamma Ray mutation. And let\u2019s say even with the first subjects actual designed Novas can have their powerset or at least themes roughly reined.<br /> <br /> So basically in my setting When Mal Bathed the World in Quantum it was like he unlocked the X Factor Potential in Humanity, so people can spontaneously erupt becoming first gen Novas. But because the World was filled with Quantum Novas would start errupting from Science Accidents more often, so maybe Peter Parker would of died from Radioactive Venom if he was bitten by a spider before Divis Mal bathed the world in Quantum, but since he was bitten after Quantum was throbbing through Earth the Radioactive Bite causes him to Errupt, and mutate in order to survive.<br /> <br /> Maybe science experiments like Curt Connors Lizard Serum would have flat out failed if he tried it before Divis Mal\u2019s Quantum Wave, just a good set of Data on Reptiles but an inconclusive method of applying the genetic retrovirus, so his serum may have just made you sick or killed you or gave you a genetic disease. Or possibly it would never have gotten to the stage of being a serum, so he he couldn\u2019t figure out how to tie together the various lizard dna samples to make his regeneration serum, he couldn\u2019t make anything but inert organic liquids.<br /> <br /> But things weren\u2019t impossible before Divis Mal\u2019s Project. Enough Quantum was in the Air After the Hammersmith Incident even if it was most potent till about the 50s, so during the time period of Adventure! Science Experiments and Accidents has a much greater chance to create Novas then before the Hammersmith Incident, but still not as likely as the Nova age due to the uncontested Quantum of that age. Perhaps still though after the 50s when most of the Zwaves faded there was still more Quantum then before the Z wave so some Novas erupted from accidents/experiments more so then over thirty years ago it just needs enough SCIENCE! behind it. But let\u2019s say even before the Hammersmith Incident with potent Enough Science you could still make Novas its just exponentially harder then Zwave or Nova Era due to lack of Ambient Earthly Quantum. So you wouldn\u2019t have a Nova Erupting as Industrial Lathe Man from coal, but if advanced Aliens use a gene cocktail on an abducted Spanish War Soldier while Bombarding him with a Nicoll-Dyson beam, that soldier could still erupt due to the inherent quality of Humanity\u2019s Quantum Potential.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-15T09:03:42-08:00","id":1288279,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1288053-ideally-how-do-you-want-reproduction-to-be-handled?p=1288183#post1288183\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You are assuming far more control of the Novas\u2019 nature by Mal than I do Lian. Far as I can tell he bathed the Earth in Quantum energy to trigger eruptions, but he did not engineer Novas the way the Doyen engineered Psions.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I don't think he engineered them to the Extent that the Doyen did, BUT I do think he did more than just &quot;Make Novas more likely to happen&quot;/ Powers to effect the Earth and every person on the earth was a thing. Powers functionally on a subconscious level based on people's beliefs and desires are a thing. I think that some of the &quot;novas as distant gods&quot; thing is magnified by Mal's view of himself as such.<br /> <br /> The Doyen were a lot more specific on wanting tools to kill Novas. They wanted them produceable on an industrial fashion. They wanted these aptitudes. etc. Mal just wanted more &quot;people like me&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-15T09:42:28-08:00","id":1288297,"title":"","content":"I understand what you mean, and I agree he didn\u2019t just make them more likely to appear, he also made them more powerful by the time they erupted. But I don\u2019t think he did plan to create a Increasing population of novas or erupt the entire world, as I think he was not the god he seams to be when he showed up later. To be honest, I don\u2019t think we had the entire effect on mind when it exploded, he was probably testing, as did Hammersmith during the accident, and needed a greater model to test his theory.<br /> <br /> The same event that caused the novas to erupt on high power, probably raised his own power, like what happened to Sarah after her Psi explosion, that give her QK (probably she was not fully aware of the possibility of raising her powers either). Maybe it was intentional, maybe a happy accident, but the fact he sees himself as a god in the 70s and 80s, doesn\u2019t mean he was as powerful as one.<br /> <br /> On the letters you can see he saw him as a god back in the 40s, before fighting Aeon (1e at least), and back than he was a very powerful Stalwart, but not a powerful nova. He didn\u2019t expect the gods to be as powerful as novas, he had the understanding of how stories were told and changed to be more interesting. He knew that if a guy were able to fight an elefant (possible to a Stalwart) people would say he was capable of throwing mountains in a matter of time.<br /> <br /> Even his Chrysalis were not so efficient before Galetea, it was not matter of how much experience on using his powers, it was a matter of available energy, otherwise any Stalwart would became a Nova if trained enough, but that\u2019s not what happened.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-15T11:32:03-08:00","id":1288338,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1288053-ideally-how-do-you-want-reproduction-to-be-handled?p=1288279#post1288279\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I don't think he engineered them to the Extent that the Doyen did, BUT I do think he did more than just &amp;quot;Make Novas more likely to happen&amp;quot;/ Powers to effect the Earth and every person on the earth was a thing. Powers functionally on a subconscious level based on people's beliefs and desires are a thing. I think that some of the &amp;quot;novas as distant gods&amp;quot; thing is magnified by Mal's view of himself as such.<br /> <br /> The Doyen were a lot more specific on wanting tools to kill Novas. They wanted them produceable on an industrial fashion. They wanted these aptitudes. etc. Mal just wanted more &amp;quot;people like me&amp;quot;<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>\u201cMore likely\u201d is understating it. He caused mass global eruptions. But nothing in the setting indicates Novas\u2019 nature are shaped by his subconcious as opposed to the subconscious of the people erupting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-15T12:05:22-08:00","id":1288350,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1288053-ideally-how-do-you-want-reproduction-to-be-handled?p=1288297#post1288297\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I understand what you mean, and I agree he didn\u2019t just make them more likely to appear, he also made them more powerful by the time they erupted. But I don\u2019t think he did plan to create a Increasing population of novas or erupt the entire world, as I think he was not the god he seams to be when he showed up later. To be honest, I don\u2019t think we had the entire effect on mind when it exploded, he was probably testing, as did Hammersmith during the accident, and needed a greater model to test his theory.<br /> <br /> The same event that caused the novas to erupt on high power, probably raised his own power, like what happened to Sarah after her Psi explosion, that give her QK (probably she was not fully aware of the possibility of raising her powers either). Maybe it was intentional, maybe a happy accident, but the fact he sees himself as a god in the 70s and 80s, doesn\u2019t mean he was as powerful as one.<br /> <br /> On the letters you can see he saw him as a god back in the 40s, before fighting Aeon (1e at least), and back than he was a very powerful Stalwart, but not a powerful nova. He didn\u2019t expect the gods to be as powerful as novas, he had the understanding of how stories were told and changed to be more interesting. He knew that if a guy were able to fight an elefant (possible to a Stalwart) people would say he was capable of throwing mountains in a matter of time.<br /> <br /> Even his Chrysalis were not so efficient before Galetea, it was not matter of how much experience on using his powers, it was a matter of available energy, otherwise any Stalwart would became a Nova if trained enough, but that\u2019s not what happened.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it did happen but was rare, as most Stalwarts seemed to fade out after the age of Adventure. And the Quantum event boosted people anyways so you maybe didn\u2019t notice, like maybe those that did also got boosted by the event so they skipped a lot of normal Nova development and went into godmode.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-15T12:19:37-08:00","id":1288358,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1288053-ideally-how-do-you-want-reproduction-to-be-handled?p=1288350#post1288350\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think it did happen but was rare, as most Stalwarts seemed to fade out after the age of Adventure. And the Quantum event boosted people anyways so you maybe didn\u2019t notice, like maybe those that did also got boosted by the event so they skipped a lot of normal Nova development and went into godmode.</div> </div> </div> </div>True, probably what happened to Pax and Scripture. Don\u2019t know if it would be possible to cross the limit without a \u201cbooster\u201d, like Hammersmith or Mal accidents (Mal had Hammersmith, the rest had Mal). Let\u2019s say the Greek gods were novas, they would probably be on Stalwart levels, and possibly having some Supertech to throw lightings or never miss a shot. Probably the best way to handle ancient gods and their birthrights (using Trinity standard, not Scion, obviously).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-15T12:42:33-08:00","id":1288364,"title":"","content":"Also I\u2019m still defining some of my odd eruption theory so I have a question how would the setting handle the Ironfist and Immortal Weopon of the Capital Cities of Heaven. So basically the Ironfist is. Special refined Chi, and usually you inherit it after another Iron Fist dies, but also if one retires or goes AWOL like Orson Randal.<br /> <br /> So the Iron Fist allows superhuman feats of skill, speed and strength and it\u2019s eponymous Ironfist, which is gather a your qi in a concentrated aura around your fist or another extremity making it indestructible and explosive. Later he learned other Ironfists developed methods to channel the Ironfist into weapons like swords, staves, or arrows and bullets.<br /> <br /> So it sounds like it could be either an expression of Psi or Quantum, it\u2019s a bit out their for Flux. But to inherit it you have to prove worthy by beating the Shou-Lao the Undying, a dragon that seemed to be a living incarnation of the Ironfist, that steward the Energy and keeps the keys to its power in its very heart. If you plunge your fist into Shou-Lao\u2019s heart your chest is branded with the Dragons symbol and you posses the Iron Fist and become the Immortal Weapon of Kun Lun. Now Kun Lun and the Iron Fist are a perfect Example or something that what come about with the Z-Wave, but those faded, though I may make an exception and say it stayed or somehow rewrote history. Kun Lun could be an Ancient City of Immortals, but would Qi Masters Fit better as Psi or Quantum users? A lot of the Iron Fist has Psi powers but defined in a narrow but potent way, so what do you think of a \u201cPsion\u201d (nonPrometheus Psion) whose Psi Aptitude\u2019s are channeled through Martial Arts and Meditation, and which takes the form of say an inherited Qi, so like you embody the Qi of a Noetic being that seems to be a Dragon. Shou-Lao in this case seems to be a dragon which could be one of those Ascended Noetic entities who dips into the mortal reality to steward humanity using the Ironfist.<br /> <br /> Or Kun Lun could be a Quantum City, held in a pocket Dimension using Quantum, some of the people there use low level Quantum powers, but if you prove worthy by besting Shou Lao, who may be an Ascended Quantum Being or maybe a Construct/Avatar/Familiar of such a Being, you erupt with a specific Quantum signature of the Iron Fist? While his powers could be reflected with Psi it could also quite easily I suppose be Nova powers.<br /> <br /> Or should I do a mix of Both. Kun Lun is an otherworldly pocket dimension, and it most beings who use Qi are actually Psiads, with Talents mixed in for those who don\u2019t manifest vulgar Qi displays. But at the heart of this Psi society is a Being of Pure Quantum. Shou-Lao holds all the Quantum of Kun Lun in his body, this helps prevent corruption in the city\u2019s Qi and keeps everyone\u2019s Qi healthy since Quantum and Psi are antithetical to each other. The one who becomes the Ironfist however erupt using the Quantum of Shou-Lao so they can do things most of the other Qi users can\u2019t do as they posses the Singularly potent Golden Qi of Shou-Lao the Undying, but Golden Qi is actually Quantum and the subtle Qi other masters use is Psi, and Flux.<br /> <br /> My issue is it seems due to having to train for like at least a decade, and beat a dragon with your bare fists you are probably a Talent. The setting would be easier for me if Psi and Quantum Eruptions could Overwrite Flux and Convert Talents into another Splat. But only basic Talents and not those more entrenched in Flux, the Various next stage Talents proposed here on the Forums.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-15T12:50:16-08:00","id":1288368,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1288053-ideally-how-do-you-want-reproduction-to-be-handled?p=1288358#post1288358\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> True, probably what happened to Pax and Scripture. Don\u2019t know if it would be possible to cross the limit without a \u201cbooster\u201d, like Hammersmith or Mal accidents (Mal had Hammersmith, the rest had Mal). Let\u2019s say the Greek gods were novas, they would probably be on Stalwart levels, and possibly having some Supertech to throw lightings or never miss a shot. Probably the best way to handle ancient gods and their birthrights (using Trinity standard, not Scion, obviously).</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually I\u2019m going to take a wild swing and say the gods were full on Nova level, and maybe the Demigods started at Stalwart level. We seem have hints that the Quantum in the air during the Aegis Age meant lessened Psion manifestation unlike the Hammersmith Incident which mixed everything up and this kept levels low but varied in Flux, Psi and Quantum. I expect they had high Level Quantum influencing the Gods. Like perhaps Novas from the future or the Past. Or the Titans were Alien or Ascended Quantum Beings that empowered Early man into gods, which is my theory of Handling Aegis like the Celestials and Eternals. Maybe the Gods were hybrids of Alien Novas, the Titans, and Humans.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-15T19:01:20-08:00","id":1288476,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1288053-ideally-how-do-you-want-reproduction-to-be-handled?p=1288338#post1288338\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u201cMore likely\u201d is understating it. He caused mass global eruptions. But nothing in the setting indicates Novas\u2019 nature are shaped by his subconcious as opposed to the subconscious of the people erupting.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The more Super stuff(Flux, Psi, Quantum) the more it perpetuates the creation of new entities. That's why I think Allegences are so important to Talents. We know that subconsciousness does effect how a person's power manifests and at least at one point Mal is responsible for functionally using Global Quatumn supremecy but there's also all sorts of high end quantum powers that will effect a species. <br /> <br /> Mal wanted a people to belong to. This is clear. He MAY have had to power to litterally make this so. <br /> <br /> <br /> I&quot;m also slightly of the opinion like how other races are naturally psychic or novay humanity is NATURALLY Talented its just Talent allows the other two in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-15T19:03:46-08:00","id":1288477,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1288053-ideally-how-do-you-want-reproduction-to-be-handled?p=1288368#post1288368\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Actually I\u2019m going to take a wild swing and say the gods were full on Nova level, and maybe the Demigods started at Stalwart level. We seem have hints that the Quantum in the air during the Aegis Age meant lessened Psion manifestation unlike the Hammersmith Incident which mixed everything up and this kept levels low but varied in Flux, Psi and Quantum. I expect they had high Level Quantum influencing the Gods. Like perhaps Novas from the future or the Past. Or the Titans were Alien or Ascended Quantum Beings that empowered Early man into gods, which is my theory of Handling Aegis like the Celestials and Eternals. Maybe the Gods were hybrids of Alien Novas, the Titans, and Humans.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Nah the Greek Gods were totally Stalwarts. Now the Hindu Gods.. that's where you get Novas...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-15T21:01:20-08:00","id":1288511,"title":"","content":"... really throwing Lighting Bolts that can tame the Titans of the Land and Sky, breathing life into a statue, always being invisible to mortals, arrows that can cause sickness or love, erupting a mortal so he can turn things into gold, erupt another so she can see the future, banish a soul to toil for eternity, lifting up Mount Etna and throwing it at a giant monster that could have defeated your whole family of Gods besides you, causing a Earthquakes with your physical might, creating horses and bulls from nothing, turning Rocks into people, turning ants into people, sealing wind into a bag, need I go on? These are all Stalwart feats? Damn I must have underestimated Stalwarts!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-16T18:49:24-08:00","id":1288804,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1288053-ideally-how-do-you-want-reproduction-to-be-handled?p=1288511#post1288511\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">... really throwing Lighting Bolts that can tame the Titans of the Land and Sky, breathing life into a statue, always being invisible to mortals, arrows that can cause sickness or love, erupting a mortal so he can turn things into gold, erupt another so she can see the future, banish a soul to toil for eternity, lifting up Mount Etna and throwing it at a giant monster that could have defeated your whole family of Gods besides you, causing a Earthquakes with your physical might, creating horses and bulls from nothing, turning Rocks into people, turning ants into people, sealing wind into a bag, need I go on? These are all Stalwart feats? Damn I must have underestimated Stalwarts!</div> </div> </div> </div>You totally over estimate the Greek Gods. They can barely fight off mortals! See the Iliad. Compare to the over the top power that is the Mahbarata or the Journey to the West.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-16T22:09:46-08:00","id":1288845,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1288053-ideally-how-do-you-want-reproduction-to-be-handled?p=1288804#post1288804\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You totally over estimate the Greek Gods. They can barely fight off mortals! See the Iliad. Compare to the over the top power that is the Mahbarata or the Journey to the West.</div> </div> </div> </div>You are cherry picking to the extent that leads me to believe you haven\u2019t studied the Illiad to the Degree you imply. First off the only Mortal to Harm the gods in the the Illiad is Diomedes, and in fact besides Heracles,a Demigod son of the King of the Gods, Diomedes is known to be literally the only mortal to harm an Olympian physically. And in that specific day of the Trojan war he attached Aphrodite\u2019s who isn\u2019t at all a warrior and didn\u2019t know Diomedes could even percieve her. He had armor built by Hephaestus, and had Athena bless his Shield and Helmet. He wasn\u2019t able to Wound Apollo and he bowed out. And even Ares took the form of a man to fight in the War by the time he encountered Diomedes Ares lost the Blessing of his Mother to fight the Mortals Armies of the Greeks while Hera Blessed Athena to stop him. Athena used the Helmut of Hades which made her imperceptible to even the eyes of a god, and drove Diomedes Chariot for him, remember she literally invented Chariots and is a mighty good driver. Ares not knowing Diomedes wasn\u2019t alone under estimated him, after all he is a lone mortal and what is he going to do hit a god even in human form while he is also concentrating on Driving. Athena while unseen intercepted the spear of Ares and guided Diomedes\u2019 spear to harm Ares.<br /> <br /> So... you are gravely misrepresent things. Seriously give me an example of a mortal that wasn\u2019t Diomedes or Giant Slaying Heracles who even harmed a god. And meanwhile Ares has a bad track record. We know he was a war Captive of the Giants when they went to war with Olympus and we also know Apollo beat him in a boxing match once. Meanwhile Diomedes is the greatest mortal Warrior of his time, arguably ever even, that wasn\u2019t Achilles (who himself was a child of an Immortal Neirid destined to give birth to a supremely capable son no matter who she mates with). And before Ares got played he killed the hell out of a number of mortals that same day.<br /> <br /> Nowhere did I say the Veddic gods weren\u2019t impressive, but considering how much more massive the entire Mahabharata is compared to the Illiad I am not expecting a more comprehensive understanding of that source given here. And Journey to the West was written much later than Both the Illiad and the Mahabharata. it\u2019s a total Silver Age Comic book most of the time, and Sun Wukong makes everyone look like Jobbers, so really it\u2019s not the comparison you think it is.<br /> <br /> But seriously none of my points have been refuted. Can Stalwarts literally cause Earthquakes with their Arms, or turn an anthill into an army of fearless warriors, or throw a mountain ontop of a Giant monster, a monster so big and terrifying that dropping a mountain on him wouldn\u2019t kill him and only imprison him.<br /> <br /> These are really the things a Stalwart would do? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-17T15:10:32-08:00","id":1289006,"title":"","content":"The Veddic Gods and the Chinese Gods are Silver age Superman while The Greeks are Golden Age heroes. There is a clear level of power progression. Apollo had Difficulty keeping Patriclus out of Troy. Maybe it wasn't a fight ot the Death but if you can't keep one guy out of the most defended city of the time. You are cherry picking all the &quot;most extreme&quot; ends of things. If you ignore the Just so stories or consider them perhaps SUper science(&quot;how do you make a race out of ants.. SCIENCE!) then they scale down.<br /> <br /> ..conversely there's no low end of Rama vs Ravana.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-18T06:28:55-08:00","id":1289167,"title":"","content":"...no one said they weren\u2019t super mighty in Hindu legend, no one argued that. All that was brought up is that you couldn\u2019t portray the Greek Gods as given in Legend with only Stalwarts. You would literally have to ignore most of their God Powers.<br /> <br /> But this isn\u2019t a pissing contest thread.<br /> <br /> But back on subject if we had a colony composed only of Psions and one composed only of Psiads, what would their population look like in a few generations. I guess Psions need something the equivalent of a Prometheus Chamber though.<br /> <br /> <br /> And what happens when you Clone a Psion? Does the infant version grow up as a Latent or a full on Psion.<br /> <br /> Same with if you Clone a Nova.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-18T09:39:50-08:00","id":1289209,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1288053-ideally-how-do-you-want-reproduction-to-be-handled?p=1289167#post1289167\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But back on subject if we had a colony composed only of Psions and one composed only of Psiads, what would their population look like in a few generations. I guess Psions need something the equivalent of a Prometheus Chamber though.</div> </div> </div> </div>An ever increasing amount of Latents and psiads until see the Book Childhoods End.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> And what happens when you Clone a Psion? Does the infant version grow up as a Latent or a full on Psion.<br /> <br /> Same with if you Clone a Nova. </div> </div> </div>Since Doyen science allowed the production of artiifcial Psi I'm just going to say since cloning is either Novatech or psitech its a yes but.. it wouldn't be any easier to do than to make a construct that's a psi or a nova.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-18T13:56:38-08:00","id":1289300,"title":"","content":"A clone of a psion shoud be a latent or psiad. The Prometheus effect should be on the DNA, but also affect the Psionic Template, I would say a QK and a VK working together can turn a neutral into a psion, maybe permanent effect.<br /> <br /> About a nova, he would be a \u201clatent\u201d nova, but would not erupt with no reason. Also, when erupted, the clone can get any power, even if not the same as the original, even a different theme...<br /> <br /> Kids work different, I would say Novas and Psions are recessive genes, so probably would need a gradual mixing and matching to increase the percentage of novas and psions on the world total population, if not using VK and QK to change the genes and templates.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}